    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aequĭlībrĭum</span></b> ,
			ii, n.
		aequilibris, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a level</i> or <i>horizontal
			position</i>, <i>equilibrium</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quaedam ligna ad medium submersa ad
					aequilibrium aquae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 3, 25</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">Col. Arb. 5,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a perfect
			equality</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rumpendi pariter membri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					20, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
